---
/** The home page's opening, in the landing's type: eyebrow, two-line headline with a red second line, lede, two buttons. */
---

<section class="cal-hero not-content">
	<span class="cal-eyebrow">Calimero docs</span>
	<h1>
		Ship the app.
		<em>Skip the infrastructure.</em>
	</h1>
	<p class="lede">
		Write your app once and run it sealed on Calimero Cloud. Every node proves what it runs before it gets keys, every
		client checks that proof before it sends anything, and nobody operating the nodes, Calimero included, can read the
		data inside.
	</p>
	<div class="ctas">
		<a class="btn ink" href="/getting-started/">Quickstart</a>
		<a class="btn line" href="/build/">Build an app</a>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.cal-hero {
		padding: 1.5rem 0 2.25rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--cal-rule);
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}
	h1 {
		font-weight: 800;
		font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.25rem);
		line-height: 0.98;
		letter-spacing: -0.045em;
		margin: 1.1rem 0 1.25rem;
		color: var(--cal-ink);
	}
	h1 em {
		display: block;
		font-style: normal;
		color: var(--cal-seal);
	}
	.lede {
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		line-height: 1.55;
		color: var(--cal-ink-2);
		max-width: 40ch;
		margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
	}
	.ctas {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 12px;
	}
	.btn {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 13px 20px;
		font: 600 15px/1 var(--sl-font);
		text-decoration: none;
		border: 1px solid var(--cal-ink);
		color: var(--cal-ink);
	}
	.btn.ink {
		background: var(--cal-ink);
		color: var(--cal-paper);
	}
	.btn.ink:hover {
		background: var(--cal-seal);
		border-color: var(--cal-seal);
	}
	.btn.line:hover {
		background: var(--cal-ink);
		color: var(--cal-paper);
	}
</style>
